<title>USA: Belden &amp; Blake adds 19.5 bln cubic ft gas.</title>
<headline>Belden &amp; Blake adds 19.5 bln cubic ft gas.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CANTON, Ohio 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belden &amp; Blake Corp said on Friday it added about 19.5 billion cubic feet of gas to its reserves as a result of drilling through August 31.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it intended to replace at least 125 percent of its 1996 production through its 1996 drilling program.</p>
</text>
